    {
      "location": "x-axis label",
      "fact": "'Year' with ticks 1880 through 1891 in one-year steps."
    },
    {
      "location": "form field 'Program record'",
      "fact": "Value 'Town Z new tourists'."
    },
    {
      "location": "form field 'Review period'",
      "fact": "Value '1880-1891 tourism record'."
    },
    {
      "location": "form field 'Operations program'",
      "fact": "Value 'Tourism response routing'."
    }
  ],
  "public_definitions": [
    "Task scope: 'Review the Town Z new-tourists dashboard for 1880-1891, then choose the tourism program route that matches the overall visitor trend.'",
    "Option 1: 'Route Town Z to tourism growth planning'.",
    "Option 2: 'Route Town Z to tourism decline response'.",
    "Option 3: 'Keep Town Z on routine tourism monitoring'."
  ],
  "uncertain": [
    "The chart title states 'Decreasing' while the plotted line rises from ~1,000 in 1880 to ~3,000 in 1891; the title and the visual data conflict, so the basis for the 'overall trend' (title text vs. plotted line) is unresolved.",
    "No numeric data labels are printed on the line, so exact per-year values are read only from gridline proximity."
  ]
